{
  "work_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol",
  "source_path": "pta-peshitta/PsSol.json",
  "source_language": "syc",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.2.4",
      "source_sha256": "2907129490ac2afb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "For this reason he said, “Remove them and cast them away from me.” And the beauty of his glory was not established among them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.2.31",
      "source_sha256": "8fa753e08d279a91",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "And his body came upon the waves in great disgrace, with no one to bury it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.2.34",
      "source_sha256": "f1f54a9ac199c3e3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "And he is king over heaven and earth, and he judges kingdoms and rulers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.2.38",
      "source_sha256": "40a9bb7fcc3cd143",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "To distinguish between the righteous and the wicked, to repay the wicked forever according to their deeds."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.3.3",
      "source_sha256": "0cb283784bb7242f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "Let the righteous always remember the Lord, with thanksgiving and with the righteousness of the Lord’s judgments."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.4.2",
      "source_sha256": "6c6ca6d48089cf96",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "Especially in your words, and especially in your signs, more than anyone—the one who is harsh in his words, condemning sinners in judgment."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.5.4",
      "source_sha256": "d7d1662223ef874c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "For a person does not take captives from a mighty man."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.5.7",
      "source_sha256": "d5703cbb1cd91b2d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "In our distress we called upon you to help us, and you did not turn away our petition, because you are our God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.6.5",
      "source_sha256": "5befbfcbe91ff2eb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "And his soul will not be alarmed when crossing rivers or amid the turmoil of the seas."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.8.15",
      "source_sha256": "b65dde559db526a3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "For this reason God mixed a spirit of error for them and made them drink an undiluted cup to make them drunk."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.8.26",
      "source_sha256": "15e460b32a5d9c44",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "And Jerusalem defiled even those who sanctified the name of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.9.1",
      "source_sha256": "94dc6bde96785d4a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "When Israel went into captivity in a foreign land, when they departed from the Lord their Savior."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.9.10",
      "source_sha256": "36a0a10511064594",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "For his judgments are righteous against every person and his household."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.9.20",
      "source_sha256": "a7da5d746e337299",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "For mercy toward the house of Israel belongs to the Lord, now and forever."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.13.8",
      "source_sha256": "ae757115ac43bb70",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "For he will admonish the righteous person as his beloved son, and discipline him as a firstborn son."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.13.10",
      "source_sha256": "72444cb709dd31a4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "But sinners will be swept away to destruction, and their memory will no longer be found."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.16.3",
      "source_sha256": "3db7cde79c4bbb1c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "And when my soul turned away from the God of Israel, had the Lord not helped me in his everlasting mercy—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.16.14",
      "source_sha256": "b0f0d529ce019a2e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "When the soul wastes away in his flesh and in the distress of his poverty."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.17.15",
      "source_sha256": "cbe5a7555122764b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "In a foreign land the enemy boasts, and his heart is estranged from our God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/pssol#PsSol.18.2",
      "source_sha256": "96c44a02bda8f157",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 20,
      "text": "And your goodness is bestowed in a rich gift upon Israel. Your eyes see everything, and nothing is hidden from them."
    }
  ]
}
